### ============================================================================
### Payroll — HRIS Admin API (module payroll)
### ============================================================================
# Requires the VS Code "REST Client" extension (or a compatible .http runner).
# Click "Send Request" on Login first so the token session cookie is reused.
# The payroll ID used by Calculate is taken from Create's response.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000/api
@email = admin@company.com
@password = Password123!
@periodMonth = 9
@periodYear = 2026

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/_login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Create a payroll period
# @name createPayroll
POST {{baseUrl}}/payrolls/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "period_month": {{periodMonth}},
  "period_year": {{periodYear}}
}

### Calculate the created payroll
POST {{baseUrl}}/payrolls/{{createPayroll.response.body.$.data.id}}/calculate
